00:13:32.210 --> 00:13:39.490
And that becomes, like, a part of your memory now that the blooper is real with me sitting on Steve's lap is just, like, everywhere.
这就成了你记忆的一部分，现在我和史蒂夫坐在膝盖上的那个NG镜头简直就像是，无处不在。

315
00:13:39.870 --> 00:13:40.050
Yes.
没错。

